  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1009.04 Pipe Under Wheel Loads",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1009.04 Pipe Under Wheel Loads. Pipe used under wheel loads shall be:\n\n(a) Certified by the manufacturer or distributor, or by a P.E., as being able to withstand anticipated wheel loads and installed as specified by the manufacturer; or\n\n(b) Buried at least 4 feet underground or insulated.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1000) #11184, eff 10-1-16; ss by #14486, eff 2-1-26, EXPIRES: 2-1-36",
